Core (server/src/): plan-types.ts, clip-show-joke-types.ts, clip-show-osg-types.ts, plan-progress.ts, plan-clip-show.ts + .test.ts, plan-storyboard-video.ts, guides/joke_style_examples.txt, guides/joke_types_palette.txt.

Jobs (server/src/jobs/): plan-visualization.ts, match-plan-characters.ts, plan-clip-show.ts, regenerate-clip-show-segment.ts.

Tools (server/src/tools/, 22 registered tools + tests): plan-visualization.ts (+.test), plan-preview.ts (zero client callers — verified), swap-plan-scene-frame.ts (+.test), accept-plan-scene-frame-swap.ts, replace-plan-scene-frame-swap.ts, clear-plan-scene-frame-swap.ts (+.test), set-plan-scene-frame-characters.ts (+.test), set-plan-scene-skip-prior.ts (+.test), set-plan-scene-frame-source.ts (+.test), match-plan-scene-characters.ts, accept-plan-scene-video-swap.ts, replace-plan-scene-video-swap.ts, plan-storyboard-video.ts (+.test), replace-plan-storyboard-video-storyboard.ts, replace-plan-storyboard-video-video.ts, plan-clip-show.ts, replace-plan-clip-show-asset.ts (+.test), regenerate-clip-show-segment.ts, regenerate-clip-show-osg.ts, generate-clip-show-images.ts, ensure-plan-source-frames.ts (+.test), read-plan-progress.ts (+.test), _plan-aspect.ts (+.test).

Do NOT delete (shared by keepers): scene-detect.ts, tools/_suggest-shared.ts, kie-gemini.ts, frame-utils.ts, dialog-quality.ts, jobs/_lease.ts, jobs/_transcribe.ts, tools/analyze-jokes.ts + jobs/analyze-jokes.ts (has its own inline JOKE_TYPES), tools/gen-images-all.ts, tools/even-split.ts, tools/detect-scenes.ts, prompt-surfaces.ts (no formula surfaces).

